  "evidencia": "Page: TechCrunch Disrupt New York 2016. Sentence: The conference included hackathons, meet-and-greets with investors, and special guest lectures from industry leaders such as Jessica Alba of The Honest Company, B.J. Novak of The Office, Tim Armstrong of AOL, and former Obama White House advisor David Plouffe, who is currently serving on the board of Uber.\nPage: The Honest Company. Sentence: The Honest Company is an American consumer goods company, founded by actress Jessica Alba, that emphasizes household products to supply the marketplace for ethical consumerism.\nPage: The Honest Company. Sentence: The company had $170 million in 2014 sales and was valued at $1.7 billion as of August 2015.",
